# Line endings of the kit's scripts, whatever core.autocrlf says on the
# checkout: POSIX shells refuse CRLF scripts ("bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M"),
# and cmd.exe misreads LF-only batch files. Deployed bases get the same rules
# from knowledge-base/templates/.gitattributes.template.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.command text eol=lf
knowledge-base/shell/hooks/* text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
